@* Focus moves to the new page heading on IN-APP navigation only (Store local test run 2, X-06).
   Blazor's FocusOnNavigate also fires on the first render, which put focus on the h1 of a freshly
   loaded page, so the first Tab skipped "Skip to main content". Until the first navigation nothing
   is rendered and focus stays at the document start. *@
@if (_hasNavigated)
{
    <FocusOnNavigate RouteData="RouteData" Selector="@(Selector ?? "h1")" />
}
